1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,810
Let's play chase !

25
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,610
Wan'er,

26
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,930
I will wait for you to be reborn.

27
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:57,330
6 months later

28
00:02:58,440 --> 00:02:59,450
Push !

29
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,490
Come on !

30
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,810
I see it.

31
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,210
Harder !

32
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,330
Awesome !

33
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,410
Congratulations, Mister Zhou.

34
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,730
It's a girl.

35
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,370
Mother and daughter are safe.

36
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,610
But the kid's body

37
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,250
is very weak.

38
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,650
You'll have to take care of her.

39
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,770
Definitely. Definitely.

40
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,010
Thank you.

41
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,850
Come on in.

42
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:43,490
Zhou Ru

43
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,410
It worked.

44
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:56,250
Given how weak Wan'er's Nascent Soul is,

45
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:59,130
it will take about 18 years for her to wake up

46
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,670
and recover her memory.

47
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,610
At that time,

48
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:05,650
the law of the heavens will surely come again...

49
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,610
Wan'er,

50
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,210
I will protect you.

51
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:14,890
1 year later

52
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,530
Senior,

53
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,890
Going through Chu is the easiest way to reach the Immortal Graveyard.

54
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,370
Then it's up to Senior.

55
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:29,130
I haven't come to Chu in 100 years.

56
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:31,370
There seems to be many changes.

57
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,370
Yes it has,

58
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,410
I heard that nowadays the Cloud Sky Sect

59
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,970
is the number one sect in Chu.

60
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:39,290
It's not what it used to be.

61
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,130
A messenger from Suzaku ?

62
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:58,370
What is he doing here ?

63
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:00,360
Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,

64
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,770
Mount Suzaku ordered

65
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,370
that in 3 months,

66
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,740
in the western Heaven Temple,

67
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,720
you are to fight Red Butterfly.

68
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,410
What ?

69
00:05:08,550 --> 00:05:09,570
Ceng Niu ?

70
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,890
Go back and tell them

71
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,450
that if they want a fight

72
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:19,330
it will have to be in 10 years.

73
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:24,770
This Ceng Niu is really something.

74
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,890
He doesn't even give in to the country of Suzaku.

75
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,810
Old friends in the valley,

76
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,930
please come in.

77
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,660
Old friends ?

78
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:48,530
Wang Lin ?!

79
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:48,530
It's him !

80
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,450
Fellow cultivators,

81
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,810
please sit.

82
00:05:56,840 --> 00:06:00,010
I don't know if I should call you fellow cultivator Wang

83
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,770
or fellow cultivator Ceng.

84
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,960
Names are just what we call each other.

85
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,550
There is no need to worry too much about it.

86
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,410
Back then,

87
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,410
I didn't know Senior's identity.

88
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:11,110
I hope Senior can forgive my rudeness.

89
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,370
If I understand correctly

90
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,130
you're going to the Immortal Graveyard

91
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,770
to find your father's body.

92
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,170
Exactly.

93
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,610
Brother Wang,

94
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:24,410
why don't you come with us ?

95
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:29,930
Why did you agree to go, fellow cultivator Sun ?

96
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,690
Senior,

97
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:35,210
inside the Immortal Graveyard there's a relic

98
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:37,490
named the Reincarnation Tree.

99
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,800
Junior has a map that can lead us there.

100
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,290
If you meditate under it,

101
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:45,130
you can experience a life cycle, it's useful for Soul Formation domains.

102
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:49,170
This may be helpful for Nascent Soul cultivators

103
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:51,810
but for those above the middle stage of Soul Formation

104
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,520
the effects are minimal.

105
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:57,450
I believe fellow cultivator Sun has other goals for this trip.

106
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,410
Brother Wang is very insightful,

107
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,650
I'm impressed.

108
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,290
Fellow cultivator Zi Xin, don't blame me.

109
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,370
If it was just for the Reincarnation Tree,

110
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,290
I wouldn't follow you there.

111
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,010
What I want

112
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,090
is the Reincarnation Fruit.

113
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,570
the Reincarnation Fruit ?

114
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,650
That's right !

115
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,610
The Reincarnation Fruit

116
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:22,410
will increase one's chance of reaching Soul Transformation by 30%.

117
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:25,210
It's a treasure for us Soul Formation cultivators.

118
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:27,610
If Brother Wang is willing to go

119
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,410
harvest Reincarnation Fruits,

120
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,010
we will split them evenly.

121
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,890
How does it sound ?

122
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,880
If they're so precious,

123
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,790
why don't you just keep them for yourself

124
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,210
instead of asking me for help ?

125
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:42,130
Brother Wang doesn't know

126
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,450
but the Immortal Graveyard

127
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:45,610
is a very dangerous place.

128
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:47,970
Entrance of the
Immortal Graveyard

129
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:48,890
It's the home of powerful native savages.

130
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:51,290
Even the country of Suzaku dreads them.

131
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,690
If Brother Wang accompanies me,

132
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:56,330
this trip will be much safer.

133
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,870
As long as we find the Reincarnation Tree,

134
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:02,610
I have a method for it to bear fruit

135
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,770
within 3 hours.

136
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,410
Interested now ?

137
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,250
How about this:

138
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:16,770
we will wait for you outside the Immortal Graveyard for a month.

139
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,050
If you don’t come,

140
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:19,570
it's alright.

141
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,810
We will go on our own.

142
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:22,970
See you.

143
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:31,090
Tu Si's memory mentioned the Reincarnation Fruit.

144
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:34,330
If smeared over an Ancient God's body

145
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,930
it will cleanse the meridians

146
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,850
and merge with the flesh and blood.

147
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:41,890
The speed at which the body absorbs energy

148
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,730
will increase significantly.

149
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:45,970
This process

150
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,490
is called body cleansing.

151
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,130
Only through body cleansing

152
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:53,130
can one be regarded as a true Ancient God.

153
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:57,410
Red Butterfly's residence
Country of Suzaku

154
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:06,020
The Elders were furious because Ceng Niu postponed the battle.

155
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:08,420
I wanted to go down there to catch him myself

156
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,610
but these guys stopped me again.

157
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:13,650
I don't even know who this Ceng Niu is.

158
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:16,210
I can't believe they intervened 3 times already.

159
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,270
Junior Sister,

160
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:23,750
why don't I sneak down the mountain and kill him for you ?

161
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,890
Even if they find out

162
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:27,210
they will only punish me to 100 years of secluded cultivation.

163
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,700
Stay here Senior Brother.

164
00:09:28,530 --> 00:09:30,700
Ceng Niu wanted to destroy my Dao Heart

165
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,210
but he never thought that

166
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:35,240
not only was it not destroyed,

167
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,320
but it's even more complete now.

168
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:39,810
I don't know what the intentions of Mount Suzaku are

169
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,530
regarding our upcoming battle.

170
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,890
But this is exactly what I want.

171
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,290
Junior Sister,

172
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,970
Spirit of the Eastern Sea

173
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,850
This is the Spirit of the Eastern Sea that I've found,

174
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,340
it will regrow your arm.

175
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,210
Please take it.

176
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,650
I don't need it.

177
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,930
Every time I look at my empty sleeve,

178
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,490
my urge to kill Ceng Niu increases.

179
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,570
Until I kill Ceng Niu,

180
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,610
my arm will stay missing.

181
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,490
Junior Sister !

182
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:14,370
He's using my arm

183
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:15,610
to curse me.

184
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,290
Ceng Niu...

185
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:20,330
I'm definitely going to kill you !

186
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,610
One more poison curse,

187
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,650
just in case she shows up.

188
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:28,930
The country of Suzaku knows where I'm hiding.

189
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:31,210
but they didn't tell Red Butterfly

190
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,210
and only sent a challenge letter.

191
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,890
This is weird.

192
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:42,530
This battle with Red Butterfly is inevitable

193
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:45,810
so I'd better get ready.

194
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:10,450
I'm taking back the Beast Trap

195
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:12,850
to use for this beast.

196
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:16,340
If you wish to stay, then follow me.

197
00:11:16,410 --> 00:11:18,650
If you don’t, then you may leave.

198
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:36,890
Capture !

199
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:08,010
Restrain !

200
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:28,830
So you thought about it

201
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,240
and you're following me ?

202
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,730
Look at her.

203
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,600
You've had a busy day,

204
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,930
go get something to eat.

205
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,970
Come, dinner's waiting for you.

206
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,010
Wan'er...

207
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,730
Wan'er...

208
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,770
in 18 years

209
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:26,650
you will remember everything about us.

210
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,770
That's when

211
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,930
the law of the heavens will come again.

212
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:33,690
I must be prepared

213
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,650
to face it again.

214
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:41,690
The Immortal Graveyard can help me raise my cultivation.

215
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:44,370
So even if it's dangerous,

216
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:46,770
I still have to go.

217
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,610
While I'm gone,

218
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:05,410
you will take care of Wan'er.

219
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:06,570
Without fail.

220
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:07,570
Sure.

221
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,770
You have the talent

222
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:10,890
and you're hard-working.

223
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,530
Keep it up,

224
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:14,280
I'm sure you will reach Soul Formation.

225
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,680
This is for you,

226
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:16,930
study it well.

227
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:20,090
Thank you, Ancestor.

228
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,530
Look at this.

229
00:14:26,400 --> 00:14:27,690
Little Ru, look !

230
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,050
I'll come back for you.

231
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:32,490
Wait for me.

232
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:47,570
Senior,

233
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:49,330
Junior Wang Lin

234
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,970
promised Senior Zhou Yi

235
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:53,050
to take care of you for 1000 years.

236
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:54,170
Right now,

237
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:56,130
Junior will go to the Immortal Graveyard.

238
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,010
It's a very dangerous place

239
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:00,170
so I would like to borrow a sword.

240
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:11,610
The Sword Spirit

241
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,290
is gone.

242
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:15,170
If I want to use it,

243
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,890
I will need a Sword Spirit.

244
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,490
Xu Liguo,

245
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:19,570
come out.

246
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:23,690
I'm finally out !

247
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:33,850
Even if I'm your slave, you could treat me better.

248
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:48,050
With a devil as the Sword Spirit,

249
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:50,410
I can only utilize a fraction of the sword's power.

250
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,850
When I get the chance,

251
00:15:53,350 --> 00:15:55,650
I must look for a more suitable Sword Spirit.

252
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,410
Senior Sun,

253
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:11,330
it has been a month.

254
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,490
Why are we still waiting ?

255
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:16,810
Do you know how many floors there are in this place ?

256
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,770
I don't.

257
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,730
But my father said before

258
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:23,370
that this place is relatively safe above the fourth floor.

259
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:25,250
The lower you go, the more dangerous it gets.

260
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,730
And I'm certain that

261
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,810
the Reincarnation Tree is on the third floor.

262
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:30,570
My father saw it with his own eyes.

263
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,210
Including Brother Wang,

264
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:35,570
with 3 Soul Formation cultivators,

265
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:37,450
as long as we avoid the fourth floor,

266
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,410
it should be safe.

267
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:43,490
But if he doesn't come...

268
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,330
Brother Wang !

269
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:52,290
Sorry for the wait.

270
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,050
I had some minor trouble along the way.

271
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:59,170
I found this person following me

272
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:00,820
after I entered the Immortal Graveyard.

273
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:02,400
He was trying to ambush me.

274
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,290
Is he one of the native savages ?

275
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:06,970
Impossible,

276
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:09,010
the savages cannot leave the underground.

277
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,730
How did he end up here ?

278
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:14,610
I'm afraid there's something going on in the Immortal Graveyard.

279
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,170
We have to hurry,

280
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,130
I'll clear the way.

281
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:25,090
Immortal Graveyard
First floor

282
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:32,890
The entrance to the second floor is east of here.

283
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:42,050
This place is huge.

284
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:45,050
I can't scan it all with my Divine Sense.

285
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:48,410
Tattoo puppets
Immortal Graveyard

286
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,050
Senior, help me !

287
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,730
The skulls of these men

288
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:07,650
are same as what you found above ground.

289
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,090
But

290
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:11,490
none of them were savages.

291
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,450
What are they ?

292
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:15,330
Tattoo puppets.

293
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:18,210
So it's just regular puppets ?

294
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,530
It is said that the real savages

295
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:23,050
can turn a cultivator into a puppet.

296
00:18:23,630 --> 00:18:25,240
The characteristic of these puppets

297
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:28,010
are these tattoo

298
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:29,490
and red eyes.

299
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:33,810
But these tattoo puppets are not as powerful as a real savages.

300
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:37,330
You don't usually run into them until the second floor.

301
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:39,690
I don't know why they're here.

302
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:41,610
This leaf on the head of the puppet,

303
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,890
what does it mean ?

304
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:45,610
Miss ?

305
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:46,930
Lady Zi Xin,

306
00:18:46,840 --> 00:18:48,010
are you okay ?

307
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:50,810
It's fine,

308
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,930
the entrance is just ahead.

309
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:58,370
Miss, be careful.

310
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:01,610
Forsaken Immortal Clan
3-leaf Shaman

311
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,050
A real savage

312
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:06,650
with Nascent Soul cultivation !

313
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:15,290
(Forsaken Immortal Clan's language) Invaders,

314
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:16,970
you are all

315
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,730
going to die !

316
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:28,220
Why are there such savages

317
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:30,130
in planet Suzaku's underground ?

318
00:19:50,020 --> 00:19:53,570
To let go of the consequences of my actions

319
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:55,290
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

320
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:57,230
like scattered ink.

321
00:19:57,860 --> 00:20:04,710
As destiny falls

322
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:04,710
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

323
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:12,310
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

324
00:20:07,700 --> 00:20:12,310
wither and melt into rivers.

325
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:19,870
Who can deceive

326
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:19,870
the law of the heavens ?

327
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:23,190
Countless generations

328
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:23,190
have tried before me.

329
00:20:23,230 --> 00:20:26,910
But how could I not catch my dreams

330
00:20:25,060 --> 00:20:26,910
within my warm fingers ?

331
00:20:27,220 --> 00:20:30,990
You're at my side when I'm alone

332
00:20:30,740 --> 00:20:34,310
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

333
00:20:34,820 --> 00:20:38,270
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

334
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:42,470
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

335
00:20:40,220 --> 00:20:42,470
in the streets.

336
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:47,430
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

337
00:20:43,940 --> 00:20:47,430
Can I break the rules ?

338
00:20:47,190 --> 00:20:50,150
To run towards you !

339
00:20:49,940 --> 00:20:53,470
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

340
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:58,110
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

341
00:20:57,860 --> 00:21:01,510
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

342
00:21:01,300 --> 00:21:06,190
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

343
00:21:06,390 --> 00:21:11,870
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

344
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:15,790
If your soul is willing to wander,

345
00:21:15,540 --> 00:21:20,430
can I still take your hands

346
00:21:17,220 --> 00:21:20,430
and hold them tight ?

347
00:21:20,340 --> 00:21:23,510
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

348
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:28,390
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

349
00:21:28,150 --> 00:21:31,670
I dream of destroying

350
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:36,390
the shackles of our fate.

351
00:21:36,140 --> 00:21:40,350
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

352
00:21:40,100 --> 00:21:43,150
You're the hardest to let go of.

353
00:21:42,980 --> 00:21:47,030
I want to be with you again

354
00:21:46,860 --> 00:21:50,390
so I can look in your eyes.

355
00:21:50,420 --> 00:21:55,630
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
